{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o008a","title":"刘备任关羽前将军假节钺","accounts":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o008a-account","label":"《关张马黄赵传第六》正文","text":"刘备任关羽前将军假节钺","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o008a-q"]},{"id":"huowang-a-a8ffed04b653383dd7c6","label":"正文","text":"刘备遣诗拜关羽","evidence":["huowang-q-c7f9408621d68792ed41"]},{"id":"huowang-a-70a5c3e935ab1f8de682","label":"正文","text":"关羽耻与黄忠同列","evidence":["huowang-q-3d839b07145d47a93b8a"]},{"id":"huowang-a-4b5f517bc952eda0b08b","label":"正文","text":"费诗开谕关羽受拜","evidence":["huowang-q-ae94efcb1d0091064fb5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"任用","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"受任","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"huowang-p0030","role":"奉命拜关羽为前将军；以萧曹陈韩班列之喻与王侯一体同休等戚之义开谕关羽，谓不宜计官号高下爵禄多少","evidence":["huowang-q-c7f9408621d68792ed41","huowang-q-ae94efcb1d0091064fb5"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0051","role":"拜后将军，为关羽所轻","evidence":["huowang-q-3d839b07145d47a93b8a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"建安二十四年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"guanzhang-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"guanzhang-q-o008","basis":"建安二十四年"},"evidence":["guanzhang-e-o008a-q","guanzhang-q-o008","guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af"]},"ordering_evidence":"guanzhang-e-o008a-q","source_order":[36,36,"O008a"],"order":6853}],"persons":[{"id":"huowang-p0030","name":"费诗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0051","name":"黄忠","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o008a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180},{"id":"huowang-q-3d839b07145d47a93b8a","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-a2d44a8ea9a1d8953eaa","layer":"original","quote":"羽闻黄忠为后将军，（羽）怒曰：“大丈夫终不与老兵同列！〖2〗”不肯受拜","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":52},{"id":"huowang-q-ae94efcb1d0091064fb5","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-a2d44a8ea9a1d8953eaa","layer":"original","quote":"诗谓羽曰：“夫立王业者，所用非一。昔萧、曹与高祖少小亲旧〖3〗，而陈、韩亡命后至〖4〗；论其班列，韩最居上，未闻萧、曹以此为怨。今汉〔中〕王以一时之功〖5〗，隆崇于汉（室）〔升〕；然意之轻重〖6〗，宁当与君侯齐乎〖7〗？且王与君侯，譬犹一体；同休等戚，祸福共之。愚为君侯〖8〗，不宜计官号之高下，爵禄之多少为意也。仆一介之使〖9〗，衔命之人；君侯不受拜，如是便还；但相为惜此举动，恐有后悔耳！”羽大感悟，遽即受拜","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":259},{"id":"huowang-q-c7f9408621d68792ed41","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-a2d44a8ea9a1d8953eaa","layer":"original","quote":"先主为汉中王，遣诗拜关羽为前将军","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
